# FONTSCRAFT (rmbp-ledger B640, R124, DESIGN-LANGUAGE §2.2) — SHA-256 pins for the UI faces staged from the
# tree's `fonts/` directory (the b43.pins shape: one fact per row, `<file> <64 lowercase hex>`). The builder
# (`builder/src/main.rs` stage_fonts) puts a `fonts/<family>/<file>` on the image ONLY when its SHA-256 equals its
# row here, and refuses it on the console otherwise (`FONTS: <file> sha256=<have> != pin <want> — NOT staged`);
# arroyo's FONTS line (`ensure_kfont_noto`) prints the same verdict before every media build.
# All three families are SIL Open Font License 1.1; each directory carries its licence as `LICENSE`, staged beside
# the faces as `system/fonts/LICENSES/<family>.txt`.
# Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Rows written by the rmbp seat's FONTSCRAFT executor 2026-10-13 from the official releases, downloaded into
# ~/unaos-bench/scratch/rmbp-0915/local3/fontscraft/dl/ and hashed there (sha256sum), archive -> member:
#   Inter 4.1 (rsms/inter release v4.1, 2024-11-16): Inter-4.1.zip
#     sha256 9883fdd4a49d4fb66bd8177ba6625ef9a64aa45899767dde3d36aa425756b11e  33707794 B
#     member InterVariable.ttf (axes opsz 14..32, wght 100..900), LICENSE.txt
#   JetBrains Mono 2.304 (JetBrains/JetBrainsMono release v2.304, 2023-01-14): JetBrainsMono-2.304.zip
#     sha256 6f6376c6ed2960ea8a963cd7387ec9d76e3f629125bc33d1fdcd7eb7012f7bbf  5622857 B
#     member fonts/variable/JetBrainsMono[wght].ttf (wght 100..800), staged as JetBrainsMono-Variable.ttf; OFL.txt
#   Noto Sans 2.015 (notofonts/latin-greek-cyrillic release NotoSans-v2.015, 2024-11-20): NotoSans-v2.015.zip
#     sha256 0c34df072a3fa7efbb7cbf34950e1f971a4447cffe365d3a359e2d4089b958f5  117491253 B
#     member NotoSans/unhinted/slim-variable-ttf/NotoSans[wght].ttf (wght 400..700), staged as
#     NotoSans-Variable.ttf; OFL.txt

InterVariable.ttf 4989b125924991b90d05b2d16e0e388c48f7d5bb8b30539bbf9c755278d0ccaf
JetBrainsMono-Variable.ttf 662a196d58f1183bf2d77428b6d5283fe3f45161ab021bea4036bc98e5cac016
